{"time": 1752038639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40011158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我也想看看这是什么原理。\""}
{"time": 1752038649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922794785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉该先问问可不可以买下来）"}
{"time": 1752038752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "272484397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=40011158]“会要写时间……介意卖给我么？你知道的，贪吃鲔鱼一向是个盲盒”"}
{"time": 1752038957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "51818535", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"思考，\"并没有卖的想法，sry\""}
{"time": 1752039025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "376552370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好吧。嗯……快的话，二十分钟。如果有什么特殊情况的话会久一些”他抱起鱼，朝里间走去“小姐要旁观吗？”"}
{"time": 1752039061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "75881670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点头，拉着夏弥一起进去"}
{"time": 1752039078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441833774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1112282474]（这边就，正常赶路？）"}
{"time": 1752039096, "type": "recv", "message_id": "900178525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是的）"}
{"time": 1752039114, "type": "recv", "message_id": "744151472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(虽然我好像猜到是什么了)"}
{"time": 1752039119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2106977700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（总不能带她去海边吧）"}
{"time": 1752039127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910164617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么才猜到是什么）"}
{"time": 1752039144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1102598741", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "既然是贪吃鲔鱼，首先关注的自然是"}
{"time": 1752039148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1103725522", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(因为之前没管这个鱼)"}
{"time": 1752039226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "662510952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“胃袋……”他把鱼敲晕，随后破开鱼腹，从里剜出鱼的胃肠"}
{"time": 1752039372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1504862552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "仔细看看吞了什么东西进去了"}
{"time": 1752039377, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655203362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "随后刀尖轻挑，发酵的淡淡酸臭味随内容物一同从中溢出"}
{"time": 1752039592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984230608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "水草与半消化的鱼肉间还夹杂着几只死虫子和些许矿石碎片。但这些都不重要，哪怕那矿石是光水晶或者更珍贵的白鹭石。因为在那污秽的半消化食糜中，有那么一片泛着虹光的鳞片，固执地纤尘不染"}
{"time": 1752039616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475499349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"难怪...\""}
{"time": 1752039727, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34043123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这是……”研究员深吸一口气，坐直了身体，随后花了许久才把喜形随着肺里的浊气一起吐出“小姐认得这个？”"}
{"time": 1752039830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524347906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不认识，但是既然没有一点变化，而且能让这条鱼变异，想必也不难猜吧？\"拿起镊子夹起来"}
{"time": 1752039859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "9300330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"或许我运气真的很好?\""}
{"time": 1752039924, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209234194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“早知道，无论如何也趁着还没开封的时候买下来了”他苦笑"}
{"time": 1752040056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1140307699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"承您吉言。\"冲洗一下，在手里把玩把玩"}
{"time": 1752040076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "378103524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=9300330]你能感觉到一种亲切，鳞片的主人不需要再用名字来辨认"}
{"time": 1752040110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "569243331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这条鱼，要是熬成汤倒也是挺补的。\""}
{"time": 1752040228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "933742415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“希望它在研究完成之前别臭了……”他并没有就此停手，而是接着细分其他部位"}
{"time": 1752040239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461242250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不过想也知道，难有建树"}
{"time": 1752040346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759196809", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"感谢您，这条鱼要不就送您回去熬汤?\""}
{"time": 1752040472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "407128302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……作为食物实在太过浪费了。只有能解明……不，能再多百分之一的了解……就足够我发表新的论文了”"}
{"time": 1752040503, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1820144214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（写100篇论文（）"}
