{"time": 1752041694, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404486497", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1597996151]“嗯……身上剩的位置也不多了”\n的确，夏弥头上顶着一个小金属王冠，颈上围着一个颈环，还挂着一个风铃"}
{"time": 1752041706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "320995958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "大概只剩腕部了"}
