{"time": 1752048048, "type": "recv", "message_id": "985033230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（刚刚我妈教育了我一会（）"}
{"time": 1752048052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749440926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(厉害)"}
{"time": 1752048087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1438913001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“沧澜，这5k给你”分出一半"}
{"time": 1752048112, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1258598021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1594893762]那就打包一套鱼相关的套餐送给绘梨衣吧，敲敲门。"}
{"time": 1752048121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "562141627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(感觉今天下午我的行动尤其人机)"}
