{"time": 1752052423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "416950260", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"露儿为什么觉得我有心事?\""}
{"time": 1752052461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903024180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“今天中午，看见安姐姐好像不怎么开心”"}
{"time": 1752052476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "759660355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "把玩着勺子，\"前几天我是有些生气露儿的莽撞，现在还有没有做那些有危险的事?\"有一搭没一搭开口"}
{"time": 1752052508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026286984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没有没有”快速摇头"}
{"time": 1752052616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941627281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，要为自己着想，活着才是最重要的，知道吗？\"尽力打起笑容，\"现在露儿就做得很好。\""}
{"time": 1752052684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "458412159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，上次被熊追的时候，我就已经深有感悟了”"}
{"time": 1752052766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1215491886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是吗？那你后来还直接跳下水?\"放下勺子喝口茶，但是却是说家常的口气"}
{"time": 1752052944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "529439012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我感觉我和水蛮亲近的...”"}
{"time": 1752052966, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1351955632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“进水里有种emmm如履平地？的感觉”"}
{"time": 1752053138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1444109855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...唉\"叹口气，\"或许是我想当然了\""}
{"time": 1752053203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1069495671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "泡狐龙定食最先登场，居然是甜品。三串粉、白、紫配色的流心团子为主食，配上印着狐狸头图案的油炸豆腐"}
{"time": 1752053217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677629244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "自然是鱼豆腐"}
