{"time": 1752064946, "type": "recv", "message_id": "930540543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那电是什么颜色的”"}
{"time": 1752064978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "972212003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然是蓝色……还能有别的颜色？”"}
{"time": 1752064993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "412427400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“红色之类的”"}
{"time": 1752065001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353019495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"可能是从别的地方来的。\""}
{"time": 1752065007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082377975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“从来没见过”"}
{"time": 1752065119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1547247353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "事已至此，\"我只能劝你不要贸然接近那边，露儿。但是，你真的要去的话，我也不会说什么。\""}
{"time": 1752065244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1952023402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，我不会贸然靠近的”"}
{"time": 1752065428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "826678551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“陆地和天上的东西，再怎么棘手，总不至于无计可施”夏弥站到安身后“但……我不会让安冒着生命危险去我触及不了的水中”"}
{"time": 1752065486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2142965548", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"抿着嘴唇，\"深海..\""}
{"time": 1752065506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1743742432", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你们要去海里找什么吗”"}
{"time": 1752065644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524029666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我对那片海不感兴趣，露儿，想去的是你。\""}
{"time": 1752065733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1963948511", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emm，但目前来看，那片海好像不一定有我想找的东西”"}
{"time": 1752065782, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209488218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我基本没什么问题了，沧澜还有吗”"}
{"time": 1752065866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1800301257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“像我这样的，还有几个？像你们这样的，又有几个？不过，我只是出于好奇”"}
{"time": 1752065879, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1343466643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是吗？\"但不准备叮嘱她什么，面色上带出一些担忧"}
{"time": 1752066004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063591631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不告诉我，也没关系。但我想知道，之后，我该怎么办”"}
{"time": 1752066054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2104808454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“既然你是因为我才这样的，那我会对你负责的”"}
{"time": 1752066186, "type": "recv", "message_id": "114533908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这话很奇怪”"}
{"time": 1752066202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1624844923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我的人生为什么要由你负责？”"}
{"time": 1752066228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1371130613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可能是因为我毁了你的龙生吧”"}
{"time": 1752066265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1599593568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“？”"}
{"time": 1752066303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1581296645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "扑哧一笑，随后注意到有些失态，捂住嘴"}
{"time": 1752066308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "737691540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还不如我自己来”"}
{"time": 1752066352, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1395347398", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那你还想变回龙吗”"}
{"time": 1752066372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295486862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你是抱着什么心情，说出这句话的？）"}
{"time": 1752066414, "type": "recv", "message_id": "124995350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你这家伙，满脑子都是自己呢）"}
{"time": 1752066425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "531610920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是的）"}
{"time": 1752066442, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1520266621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我还以为我们一起狩猎大家都很快乐的）"}
{"time": 1752066454, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1787638930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你也说了还要一起狩猎对吗）"}
{"time": 1752066456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664002560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2063591631]\"这个问题没有答案。\""}
{"time": 1752066458, "type": "recv", "message_id": "662258415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1395347398]“我要做的事，又不会变”"}
{"time": 1752066490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1537084984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“你要做什么？向那只古龙复仇吗”"}
{"time": 1752066502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1424840853", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然，那是我是海疆”"}
{"time": 1752066518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1784201092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=664002560]止住笑，\"你想做什么，才是答案，而不是向我寻求\""}
{"time": 1752066623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1252367945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"之后你要做什么，你这不是很清楚吗？\""}
{"time": 1752066631, "type": "recv", "message_id": "965895048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“除了复仇以外，我还没想到”"}
{"time": 1752066658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "90197297", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是目前，就算你伤好了也没有什么希望吧”"}
{"time": 1752066739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "272415873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那就以后再想，余生还长。\"往后一仰，倒在夏弥怀里"}
{"time": 1752066783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418250363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=90197297]“不管要花多久，我一定会成长到足以击败它的程度”"}
{"time": 1752066809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "225110738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说实话，我也不知道我的目标应该是什么，也不知道是什么让我还留在这。\""}
{"time": 1752066826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1450063358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“加油”"}
{"time": 1752066930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "857817150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"撇撇头发，\"露儿安慰我吗？\""}
{"time": 1752066950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "240552453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐也加油”"}
{"time": 1752066972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "362489635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=7D191123216E9DABB1AACF49C4BDF12E.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRzdz0kp5wcrwSbLWOEi7S7Vph9KBjJjAEg_woooKjZi-6vjgMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQnLez-bbMBYlEjfqdjo0O9XoCBPo&amp;rkey=CAESMDVu-kWDPy1jTGRneFVtU0xyuHLHVKFRSIFgVwyITgsp09YJ0uIxHPv1WYlXeciUiQ,file_size=17993]"}
{"time": 1752067037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983353456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=225110738]“嗯？难道不是为了登基吗？”夏弥笑着从背后环抱住你"}
{"time": 1752067101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1096218908", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯..虽然是这么说，但是..果然还是会迷茫嘛。\"闭上眼，\"尤其是，最近这两天..真的是对的吗？一直以来..\""}
{"time": 1752067212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "92420578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...这个旅行..真的是正确的吗夏弥...要是当初留在雪山，是不是就没有这么多事了..\""}
{"time": 1752067216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1361573241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“登基是什么”"}
