{"time": 1752074411, "type": "reply", "message_id": "76608514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]使用[火龙亚种 双雷狼龙 棘龙 青电主]演奏出:[1D4=3]"}
{"time": 1752074416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638355347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（芜湖）"}
{"time": 1752074435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2022108629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有猎人在山间一处溶洞中发现了新的天然温泉泉眼。据他本人所说，有更强的疗伤效果。但当勘探队去勘察的时候，发现那里已经变成了一头棘龙的巢穴……”"}
{"time": 1752074531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208023588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“村子方面希望提高温泉的功效，所以希望采集温泉样本……或者进行更全面的勘探。因此，不论什么方式……希望有猎人能让棘龙离开，或者在它眼下采集足够多的温泉样本”"}
{"time": 1752074537, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711268213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"棘龙?\"皱着眉，\"好危险的任务...\""}
{"time": 1752074543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "444059887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不敢接)"}
{"time": 1752074599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1546388239", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（给你康完了）"}
{"time": 1752074621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "626618088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（给你康完了）"}
{"time": 1752074624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1290289333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"其他的任务还可以尝试一下，棘龙...是不是危险性有些太高了。\""}
{"time": 1752074646, "type": "recv", "message_id": "600536718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐，接了吧 我也想去看看”"}
{"time": 1752074679, "type": "recv", "message_id": "896330568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你是？）"}
{"time": 1752074716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "508573407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"露儿...?\"对着她摇摇头，\"棘龙的危险性已经不低于一般古龙了，露儿，不要打它的主意。\""}
{"time": 1752074829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1545383751", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还有别的任务吗？\"询问，\"这个不接。\""}
{"time": 1752074995, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1280056439", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……与炎火村往来的山道上，最近出现了一头尾锤龙，影响了两方的物资往来”"}
{"time": 1752075193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1356010390", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“出于某些原因，村子对与炎火村往来的重视程度在加强。讨伐、捕获或者驱逐，无论如何，保持商道安全即可”"}
{"time": 1752075266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1775028811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这倒是可以接受的任务，而且，顺便可以去一趟炎火村?\""}
