{"time": 1752078176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1729155234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"安接了个有点远的任务，估计要外出好几天。\""}
{"time": 1752078188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "490818971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"安不在的时候，小觉不要想我哦?\""}
{"time": 1752078210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "529875523", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也不太清楚哎，可能是逐渐接越来越难的任务，然后就慢慢变强了吧”"}
{"time": 1752078234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242021781", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以这次狩猎尾锤龙感觉会收获颇丰”"}
{"time": 1752078285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1053304712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=490818971]“喔，出远门居然不带我——我猜猜，跟露儿约好了？说起来，她是不是也和我们……？”"}
