{"time": 1752078531, "type": "recv", "message_id": "49144408", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是和我们不同...露儿像是海里的生物。不过当然啦，小觉要是愿意一起，我当然是欢迎的。\""}
{"time": 1752078548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1514666903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这次去一趟炎火村，听说那边的丸子很不错。\""}
{"time": 1752078616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "47273970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=909469098]“嗯……哦，到了”不知道沧澜对你的答案满不满意，不过你们已经回到了诊所"}
{"time": 1752078769, "type": "recv", "message_id": "846330460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们回来了，蝴蝶医生”"}
{"time": 1752078777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1837682883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=49144408]“嗯……我还得照顾剩下的几个家伙，还有你们带不走的行李，嗯……这次就先算了吧”觉爽快地摇摇头“帮我带点伴手礼回来就好”"}
{"time": 1752078815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559862498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉好久没见过saki了(bushi）"}
