{"time": 1752079081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1640198811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=846330460]“哦，终于回来了”你们进门的时候，她正躺在桌子上，脖子垂在桌面外，大概是为了放松颈椎“感觉怎么样？沧澜，伤口好些了吗？一会我给你换药”"}
{"time": 1752079123, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1994747225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1212686455]顺便敲敲门"}
