{"time": 1752079566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170506206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（“你这家伙，满脑子只有自己呢”）"}
{"time": 1752079578, "type": "recv", "message_id": "647030533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不许撤）"}
{"time": 1752079597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1120828684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算了，看沧澜自己怎么说吧，我尊重她的意见”"}
{"time": 1752079687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1182933475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1716001825]“你……”她气笑了“你就那么喜欢她？非要带她走？先不说她是病人，也不说我能不能等到她回来。伤口恢复的这几天是最重要的日子，你让我等她回来慢慢观察？”"}
{"time": 1752079723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1199343655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起医生”"}
{"time": 1752079733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "169348532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我刚刚没有过脑子”"}
{"time": 1752079778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "693197105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=45148736]“哦”听起来她从五官都埋在枕头里的状态抬起了头“要干嘛”"}
{"time": 1752079874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528454970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"绘梨衣大人能出门吗？不能的话，我给你安排一下别人来送餐。\""}
{"time": 1752079895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1427430281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“沧澜还是好好养伤吧”"}
{"time": 1752080032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1063110833", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1528454970]“我走得动，不用你操心”声音听起来仍然不带正能量，但起码不似先前那般富有攻击性"}
{"time": 1752080132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200200202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，你开一下门，我跟你说一下这边的事情。\""}
{"time": 1752080162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "229217095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1427430281]“我走得动，也挥得动剑”沧澜不解“蝴蝶要观察到什么时候？我想去战斗，练手”"}
{"time": 1752080390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "470192869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1200200202]那她给你开了门，还皱着眉，依旧是穿着自己变出来的衣服。地板上，用完的药膏罐子随意扔在一旁"}
{"time": 1752080506, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330906888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "进去先收拾一下罐子，\"伤怎么样?\""}
{"time": 1752080507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1635660872", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=229217095]“你……算了，你不懂人事……啊，真是，烦死人了”蝴蝶双手抱着脑袋前仰后合了好一会，最后猛地一拍桌子，给你们两个都吓一跳“我跟你们走，反正镇上也不止我一个医馆”"}
{"time": 1752080601, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1065672493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“唉？这..这...”有点吃惊“队伍里有个上位猎人，明天看看她怎么说吧...”"}
{"time": 1752080821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "810756173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=330906888]“……”她一言不发，又趴回床上，面朝下，有意地把粉色的长头发都拢到身前，这样不会沾到伤口……背部确实是重灾区，无论是身体还是被变出来的衣服，都找不出一块半尺见方的好肉。虽然好歹都结了痂，不过想长齐肉，恐怕还得好一会。留疤多半是没法避免了"}
{"time": 1752080868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2077062906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看起来还有结上了又被抠破了的"}
{"time": 1752080903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "775557396", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1065672493]“我不管谁怎么说，你要带她就得带我，我跟定了”"}
{"time": 1752080951, "type": "recv", "message_id": "742549071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那明早见吧，蝴蝶医生，今晚沧澜先睡你这里了”"}
{"time": 1752080959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "181696337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2077062906]\"诶...为什么抠破。\"拿出药膏挤在手上，在抠破的伤口涂抹"}
{"time": 1752080964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121774119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2077062906]但起码皮肤有了不少血色，不像先前白的吓人"}
{"time": 1752080999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497287668", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=181696337]“因为痒，你没长过肉吗？”"}
{"time": 1752081022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929320025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=742549071](我在想，要不过几天再出发，正好都要养伤说是)"}
{"time": 1752081057, "type": "recv", "message_id": "256265364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1929320025]（过几天尾锤龙拆完了，那你得把任务退了给别人做）"}
{"time": 1752081067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909107506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那你直接丢给觉（）"}
{"time": 1752081118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655714782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=497287668]\"...这里面有止痒，去疤的药。\"叹口气，\"现在还用不了去疤的外用药，但是止痒的记得用。\"手指挑一些涂在她结痂的伤口"}
{"time": 1752081140, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1369439494", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1909107506](那我等明天和露儿一拍而合)"}
{"time": 1752081178, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1024338391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我突然觉得按医生的脾气她可能更应该叫芥雏子）"}
{"time": 1752081242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1855231738", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=742549071]“嗯好的快走不送”"}
{"time": 1752081265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1120593075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“明天见，沧澜”"}
{"time": 1752081271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1996639703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "回家了"}
{"time": 1752081304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "552367305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你不如现在来找我)"}
{"time": 1752081313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "775913009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(跟我说苍蓝的情况，然后我们一拍而合)"}
{"time": 1752081318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "374100519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好像也对）"}
{"time": 1752081339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1304611207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不行，还是先去问问安姐姐的想法吧，明天要是安姐姐生气了，大家不愉快就不好了"}
{"time": 1752081344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "889828440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去安姐姐那里"}
{"time": 1752081407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1663503900", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=655714782]“……”她老实趴着，大概觉得已经没有躲的必要，又或者背上的伤口她自己确实也不方便处理“为什么现在又这么想……讨好？我”"}
{"time": 1752081525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1702381550", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"行动胜于语言嘛，绘梨衣大人。\"上好药，\"嗯...也许我该考虑一下这几天不出门的事，起码得等你的情况好转。\"起身，\"嗯...好好休息，明天见\""}
{"time": 1752081604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436498379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像还是没有解释为什么啊）"}
{"time": 1752081728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40659627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那我解释一下吧)"}
{"time": 1752081810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398474442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "收拾一下她的房间，拉开窗帘，打开窗户通风，\"做了错事，总得付出实际行动来补偿对不对，否则不就是一错再错了吗？\""}
{"time": 1752082002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341413812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1398474442]她只是“哦”了一句，就没发表更多看法了。你有点担心她这几天要是继续趴下去会不会把胸趴平"}
{"time": 1752082015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1600082481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(难道原本有吗)"}
{"time": 1752082026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133655112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能有一点吧）"}
{"time": 1752082054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1817617320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好了，我先走啦。明天见。\""}
{"time": 1752082056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998159935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（体型50，应该还是有的）"}
{"time": 1752082074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1685206076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "关上门离开"}
{"time": 1752082120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "816338649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=889828440]总之到了，正好看到安在走廊上"}
{"time": 1752082183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1454422090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“安姐姐”"}
{"time": 1752082199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929579023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我有件事和你商量一下”"}
{"time": 1752082308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1085629629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯?\"回头看下房门，\"你说吧露儿\""}
{"time": 1752082360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530103303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“狩猎我想带上沧澜，但是之前治疗她的医生想要观察沧澜的状况，提出了随行的要求”"}
{"time": 1752082365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1147485769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以吗安姐姐”"}
{"time": 1752082490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1752130556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...医生随行?\"皱着眉，\"这可不是游乐场，医生真的能跟队吗\""}
{"time": 1752082519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1314722778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以我才来问安姐姐么”"}
{"time": 1752082542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "712981583", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...沧澜的情况怎么样?\""}
