{"time": 1752133436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "331375267", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1787816350]客厅里，彻一如既往帮你准备好了早饭……或许saki也有出力"}
{"time": 1752133469, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1223734681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1216141798]\"夏弥...如果有一天..安真的要什么都忘了，那之前能杀了我吗？\"有些哽咽，小声，\"与其忘记..做那种存在..不如，没有来过..\""}
{"time": 1752133875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "891843345", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1223734681]“不会有那一天的，我无比相信这一点。这是夏弥的自信哦？”夏弥轻轻擦干你的眼角“我相信，无论发生什么，安都不会忘记我的”"}
{"time": 1752134049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "879330418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=331375267]大概是简单的培根煎蛋三明治，但是分量很大，各自配了不同的酱汁，吃起来也不会腻"}
{"time": 1752134223, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1116914023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"抱着夏弥，缓缓收起情绪，良久之后开口，\"但是...现在倒是能确信，我和祂确实是同个存在。\""}
{"time": 1752134501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1739091864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1116914023]“嗯……应该很了不起吧？安会变得一样厉害吗？”"}
{"time": 1752134888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "993213206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"感觉..不行呢。安现在什么都不会，怎么变得一样厉害...\"再躺一会，起床，\"呼..去吃早餐吧，可不能因为那种事影响脚步。\""}
{"time": 1752135019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1101453062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥呢）"}
