{"time": 1752140120, "type": "recv", "message_id": "220011082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1960016825]\"那就一起去吃早餐?这几天决定好好休息一下。\""}
{"time": 1752140193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "265844797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=220011082]“你出钱的话，我考虑一下”"}
{"time": 1752140263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "255810935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，怎么变成了冰冷的金钱关系）"}
{"time": 1752140319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1112737702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧好吧，我请你就是...我给你留的钱你也看见了吧。\"扫一扫前额的碎发"}
{"time": 1752140383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "757468752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=623322462]她把手给你，大概是已经习惯了"}
{"time": 1752140430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "21105612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1112737702]“看到了，但是能用你的为什么要用我的”"}
{"time": 1752140527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "781508644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=757468752][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 很开心，带着她前往湖边“我们走了昂，医生”"}
{"time": 1752140720, "type": "recv", "message_id": "151455085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=21105612]\"呃...那不也是我的吗？\"小声，看一下她的着装"}
{"time": 1752140888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "73791427", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=781508644]“晚上按时回来，还得换药”她点头“哎要不我跟你们一起去算了”"}
{"time": 1752140987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1420115988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃....”"}
{"time": 1752140996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "376045265", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=151455085]“给我了就是我的”她白你一眼，接着吃她的早餐。衣服是你给她的那件，但是里面还是穿着她自己的“表皮”"}
{"time": 1752141115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269275653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，主打一个昏头）"}
{"time": 1752141145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182739953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=151455085]“给我了就是我的”她白你一眼，头也不回地朝食堂走去，似乎咬定了你会跟上去。衣服是你给她的那件，但是里面还是穿着她自己的“表皮”"}
{"time": 1752141303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "988123067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1420115988]“算了，我店还得看”她摆手“有什么异常情况，回来也记得告诉我”"}
