{"time": 1752142249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "685453016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "把点好的菜单递到前台，\"等伤口上的痂掉了之后，记得涂消疤的药膏。\""}
