{"time": 1752142547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1100731894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "毕竟是村子周边，小动物不少，算得上生机盎然"}
{"time": 1752142583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813169276", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1867387408]\"确实像小孩子一样呢..\"悄悄话"}
{"time": 1752142586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "238797727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但是也因此没有值得一提的怪物，无非是些小狗龙，青熊兽一流"}
{"time": 1752142777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "288851162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=813169276]“唔……弄得我负罪感越来越重了……”"}
{"time": 1752142901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "869697150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说沧澜，你有家人吗”"}
