{"time": 1752148202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573477946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好多花，好漂亮啊”"}
{"time": 1752148256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1386414627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+6"}
{"time": 1752148256, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1386414627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]演奏出: 1D20+6={18}+6=24"}
{"time": 1752148353, "type": "recv", "message_id": "632067268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不紧不慢地跟着，就当是在度假散步，放下那些七七八八的想法享受一下难得的时间。"}
{"time": 1752148433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "964106422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1573477946]“老大，好像在那边喵~”saki伸长脖子，朝一个方向指了指“不过，好像还有别的怪物喵”"}
{"time": 1752148568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1587641021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=632067268]刚出了村子，绘梨衣就把外面罩着的衣服脱了下来。但她没带包。看起来在拎着和丢地上之间纠结了好一会，最后还是侧过身，朝你扬了扬手里的衣服"}
{"time": 1752148710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "864972056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=964106422][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 顺着saki所指的方向看看"}
{"time": 1752148825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833211639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=864972056]看起来有些混乱，传来阵阵碰撞的声音。泥巴、草叶，还有一些无辜的花朵"}
{"time": 1752148859, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629586143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看样子好像可以活动一下了”"}
{"time": 1752148953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1613433050", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拔刀过去看看"}
{"time": 1752149036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "80183416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1587641021]\"那是我的衣服诶..\"幽怨地看一眼，走上前接过自己的衣服，\"干嘛脱衣服?\""}
{"time": 1752149289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173601793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1613433050]似乎是两头咸湿的大只牙兽在互相……相扑？一方是你们曾经见过的河童蛙，另一方的背部和四肢都长着粉色的绒毛，腹部则是灰暗的坚韧皮质。头顶却是鲜艳的金色冲天发型。猿猴般的长尾末端卷着一颗色彩鲜艳的……蘑菇"}
{"time": 1752149335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "49057465", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（什么时候见过的？）"}
{"time": 1752149337, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1584217966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=80183416]“出了村就不需要这个了吧”她理所应当地转过去"}
