{"time": 1752164098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "121952472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就收起来"}
{"time": 1752164105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1502906218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=844479247]\"诶...我明明一直在控制饮食啦。夏弥怎么这么说？\"捏捏自己的肚子，\"你看，没有什么肉吧？很合适啦\""}
{"time": 1752164437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "702009181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就上岸吧"}
{"time": 1752164451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244131919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1502906218]“因为总感觉最近一直在吃肉……”夏弥吐吐舌头\n绘梨衣看起来也终于有些累了。她停下来收起刀，撑着腰一脚跨在身前的一块大石头上，肩背和额角都微微冒汗“嗯……这身体居然还会出汗……喂，这儿真是猎区吗？怎么还没看见大家伙？”"}
{"time": 1752164481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1759533984", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=702009181]（这前肢也有两米长（）"}
{"time": 1752164496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221716294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过拖上岸倒是）"}
{"time": 1752164501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152129034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也还好？）"}
{"time": 1752164505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "40543340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（确实）"}
{"time": 1752164508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294890027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（也还好）"}
{"time": 1752164534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "748828545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "因为周围一直有微风流动的缘故，所以并没有出汗，走到她身边的时候，微风也顺便笼罩了她，吹掉她身上的汗珠。"}
{"time": 1752164593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145513626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "也不知道镰蟹吃什么长大的，空心的前肢也比你预料中沉一些。不过有沧澜帮你，捞上来也不算什么难事——你们一人拖着一根，在沙滩上划出两条平行线"}
{"time": 1752164624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "579838727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呼....还挺沉”"}
{"time": 1752164696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1410915293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“saki，做一下这条鱼”把金枪鱼给saki,然后再给它瓶蜂蜜“蜂蜜烤鱼怎么样”"}
{"time": 1752164708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364683818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"夏弥说得对，这段时间确实吃得肉有点多了。\"惬意地靠着夏弥回话，随后看了看绘梨衣，\"我有名字，另外，这种离村不远的地方没有大家伙是正常的。\""}
{"time": 1752164716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "650896326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哈基米烤鱼，双重）"}
{"time": 1752164851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "152218236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“沧澜，再次入水有什么感觉吗”"}
{"time": 1752164907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "459268375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1410915293]“没问题喵~还有上次买好的调料，这次saki绝~对不会翻车喵”"}
{"time": 1752164926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "44072363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（话不要说这么死）"}
{"time": 1752164939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2014858215", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翻车也是节目效果啊）"}
{"time": 1752165100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1878764898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=152218236]“差不太多”沧澜身上挂着水珠，皮肤在阳光下白得发亮。你先前买的衣服合身的部分都紧贴在她的肌肤上，不合身的装饰品全都在往下坠“就是衣服……有点碍事”"}
{"time": 1752165136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "242773433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“按理说下水应该穿泳衣来着，不过忘记买了”"}
{"time": 1752165173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "713953688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“抱歉喵”双手合十求饶"}
{"time": 1752165250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1368901376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=364683818]“没那么大的也没看见。我的熊熊呢？”她看起来有些失望，百无聊赖地给自己顺起头发来“光散步根本消化不了那么多……”"}
{"time": 1752165338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1897305717", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那我知道有个地方有熊啊)"}
{"time": 1752165344, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984025200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不仅有熊还有桃毛兽呢)"}
{"time": 1752165349, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1829246203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=713953688]“也可以不穿，不过已经结束了”她坐在saki旁边，不忘把花环拿回来，饶有兴趣地看猫猫处理鱼"}
{"time": 1752165369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "785868682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1897305717]（绘梨衣の轻松熊）"}
