{"time": 1752165426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "116642333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1368901376]\"嗯...你想要什么程度的热身对象?\""}
{"time": 1752165448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2045691814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（你两solo一把（）"}
{"time": 1752165452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "432712455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我倒是知道眠鸟的位置。\""}
{"time": 1752165474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573344862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我连武器都没带，靠筋力吗)"}
{"time": 1752165497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "82140930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（真剑试合吗）"}
{"time": 1752165508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "237861392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得重点不是武器是护甲（）"}
{"time": 1752165518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565709383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃完饭有没有突发事件，让打一架（）"}
{"time": 1752165535, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458520883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你好想打架）"}
{"time": 1752165575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799886841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我也没带甲啊)"}
{"time": 1752165581, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2054001532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我跟她打吗)"}
{"time": 1752165591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1737253295", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(几刀给我二阶段都打出来了)"}
{"time": 1752165770, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1024978778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样的生活还真是平静啊，但又有点美好”"}
{"time": 1752165797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1371510894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=432712455]“眠鸟……没见到过”她摇摇头，看向不远处的山涧“先去水边，其他的之后再说”"}
{"time": 1752165832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1064861533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd-1 幸运？"}
{"time": 1752165832, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1064861533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]使用[幸运？]演奏出:[1D20-1={19}-1=18]"}
{"time": 1752165843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "840726442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那挺幸运的）"}
{"time": 1752165851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1437727246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（saki烤鱼真好吃desuwa）"}
{"time": 1752165878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "458202145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "耸耸肩，\"跟着你走咯。\""}
{"time": 1752165888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "930759082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "保持身旁的微风可以笼罩几人"}
{"time": 1752166208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953454248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1024978778]saki熟练地掏去金枪鱼的内脏……实际上内脏只占很小一部分。随后老样子给鱼打好花刀，空空如也的鱼腹中塞上去腥的草料，架在火上有条不紊地翻烤。鱼油点点滴落，蒸腾起诱人的鲜香——当然，不能忘记刷一层甜美的蜂蜜"}
{"time": 1752166548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230649859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=930759082]到了山涧附近，温度顿时下去了不少。绘梨衣悠哉游哉地踩进水中，让水流冲走行于山中夹进指缝的污垢，然后顺手……脚把一条漂亮的鲑鱼踢上了岸"}
{"time": 1752166576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "509783928", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好香啊，saki，你厨艺越来越好了”"}
{"time": 1752166666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1931872195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1024978778]“嗯，嗯……”看起来沧澜的注意力全都集中在烤鱼颜色发生的美妙变化上，对你的话简单附和……但至少没有猛回头反驳你，对不对？"}
{"time": 1752166766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596941091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=230649859]尽管如此，还是保持着和煦的微风的状态，弯下腰捡起鱼递给白"}
{"time": 1752166797, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1674445656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伸个懒腰，在旁边做做伸展运动"}
{"time": 1752166829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1675458069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可以过个聆听）"}
{"time": 1752166843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "774300822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+4 绘梨衣"}
{"time": 1752166843, "type": "reply", "message_id": "774300822", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[张风辰]使用[绘梨衣]演奏出:[1D20+4={18}+4=22]"}
{"time": 1752166939, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1248346579", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=509783928]“明明一直都很好喵~”saki终于抬起烤串，颜色恰到好处，蜂蜜似乎在鱼表面形成了一层薄薄的脆壳"}
{"time": 1752167019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2102701584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+2"}
{"time": 1752167019, "type": "reply", "message_id": "2102701584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[天宫安]演奏出: 1D20+2={2}+2=4"}
{"time": 1752167030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1711430266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我确实一直都是聋子)"}
{"time": 1752167054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "154540898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=774300822]在你们的位置稍微上游一些的地方，不足二百米，一只鲜艳的绿色鸟龙正扇着翅膀缓缓落地，没逃过绘梨衣的耳朵"}
{"time": 1752167245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1851942578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，来了”绘梨衣眼睛亮了起来，双腿发力起跳，再轻巧落地，再起跳——无声而迅捷，有如蜻蜓点水，只看得清她粉红的长发上下翻飞"}
{"time": 1752167296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1003874861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟着视线看一眼"}
{"time": 1752167302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1244700674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(毒怪鸟还是毒妖鸟)"}
{"time": 1752167304, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2082799086", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥是不是又睡着了）"}
{"time": 1752167313, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380100452", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1244700674]（彩鸟（）"}
{"time": 1752167318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1585545827", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没）"}
{"time": 1752167339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1140799517", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就开吃"}
{"time": 1752167361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328761213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "放下心来，不紧不慢地跟着，对着夏弥笑着开口\"看来也许中午有加餐了？\""}
{"time": 1752167412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016981213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“可以吃了吗，可以吃了吗，可以吃了吗”接过一串“我开动了”"}
{"time": 1752167455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987194678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“唔……就是不知道加多少。”夏弥也不紧不慢地跟着“让她自己来没问题吗？”"}
{"time": 1752167470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1995022979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶，我也上吗？\""}
{"time": 1752167487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1946815674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好好吃”露出幸福的表情"}
{"time": 1752167555, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2137247053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2016981213]沧澜学着你的样子，也接过一条烤鱼“我开动了”。随后对着油脂最馥郁的腹部一口咬下"}
{"time": 1752167615, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1285201254", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1995022979]“是说我啦。虽然……她应该不会有生命危险？”"}
{"time": 1752167773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1076915796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"她想找个对象发泄，随着她吧。\"凑到近前观摩观摩"}
{"time": 1752167851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "146622688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2137247053]随后来不及发出感慨，一口接一口，很快签子上就只剩一颗鱼头还挂在上面，而她看起来正在纠结要不要把这个也一起吃了"}
{"time": 1752167908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1458930217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“鱼头吃起来也挺香的吧”"}
{"time": 1752168006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1466535867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1076915796]绘梨衣很快来到彩鸟附近，彩鸟自然也发现有人靠近，于是扭过头去看她。刚准备发难……却发现绘梨衣突然停下，像个木头人一样站着不动了"}
{"time": 1752168071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1672882336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "皱着眉，手里凝聚一团风团，瞄准着彩鸟随时动手"}
{"time": 1752168076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1922909210", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这种要过骰子吗)"}
{"time": 1752168144, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1852192229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1458930217]“嗯……你说得对”于是她又咔擦咔擦把有些焦脆的鱼头一起吃掉。这次是真没东西看了，只能等saki烤下一条"}
{"time": 1752168149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "625077817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1922909210]（不用吧）"}
{"time": 1752168245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "470628820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1672882336]彩鸟有些疑惑地盯着绘梨衣看了两眼，似乎是没察觉到什么威胁，于是扭过脖子去，盯着水里的游鱼探头探脑"}
{"time": 1752168397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "562158474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "保持蓄力的状态"}
{"time": 1752168441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "840128190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "而绘梨衣也就在这时阴暗地滑行着接近，在彩鸟刚挑好目标准备下嘴的时候，她轻巧地探出手，当着彩鸟的面“偷”走了它的午餐"}
{"time": 1752168507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1125000162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃..\""}
{"time": 1752168518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1489702085", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "随后发出恶作剧得逞的畅快笑声，一手叉着腰，一手把那条工具鱼一抛一抛"}
{"time": 1752168528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "393674902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（太邪恶了）"}
{"time": 1752168530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1088135039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“她在干嘛……”"}
{"time": 1752168534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126432818", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（她才是雌小鬼）"}
{"time": 1752168549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2075515658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(玩太刀玩的)"}
{"time": 1752168558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987687630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(玩太刀玩的)"}
{"time": 1752168590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1715035484", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...噗...\"手上的风团随着这一笑散去，\"搞什么...\""}
{"time": 1752168652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "827364083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "很快便吃饱了，摸着自己的肚子“好满足...”"}
{"time": 1752168711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1472212141", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1715035484]“大概确实是……有点压抑了”"}
{"time": 1752168801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "487725517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"确实...让她放松一下也好。\""}
{"time": 1752168862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073158708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=827364083]沧澜很快吃完第二条，岔开腿坐在沙滩上，很快就换了个更舒服的姿势——躺着，又很自然地在太阳的直射下闭上了眼"}
{"time": 1752168892, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1216095341", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在她身边跟着一起躺下"}
{"time": 1752168904, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1665601566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“吃饱了果然就要睡啊”"}
{"time": 1752168953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474972133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=487725517]彩鸟有些莫名其妙地看着这个犯贱的小个子，但河流里还有其他的鱼……甚至还没被吓跑。于是它换了个位置，接着锁定下一个目标"}
{"time": 1752169037, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1761941857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（过幸运？）"}
{"time": 1752169041, "type": "recv", "message_id": "586103069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这只鸟脾气好像也很好啊。\"看着他们，\"有点郎才女貌了，诶，这成语是这么用吗？\""}
{"time": 1752169067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1544684145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1665601566]“不需要维护领地的时候，就该这么做吧”沧澜的声音很放松“偶尔会追着洋流里的水母玩玩，但……睡觉很节能”"}
{"time": 1752169090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1749620290", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1761941857]（这么想打架？）"}
{"time": 1752169153, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677485880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（打架可以过时间（）"}
{"time": 1752169162, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1373310347", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=586103069]“我猜你的意思是门当户对……”"}
{"time": 1752169175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1055789233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=677485880]（睡觉也可以过时间（）"}
{"time": 1752169187, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1815955340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（打架可以加好感）"}
{"time": 1752169191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "670520498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"差不多...我去抓抓鱼吧。\""}
{"time": 1752169191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1302987436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（睡觉可以加吗）"}
